<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If I take the wings of the dawn</l><l>And dwell in the uttermost parts of the sea,</l><l>Behold, Thou art there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Even there shall Thy hand lead me</l><l>And even there Thy right hand shall hold me.</l><l>Behold, Thou art there.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
